&lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;preserve single files for fallback extraction paths (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/openai-python/issues/3875&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/openai-python/pull/3875/hovercard&quot;&gt;#3875&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/openai-python/commit/bfd3680c8d3b715bb3175b82cd0fa1c1fb53162f&quot;&gt;bfd3680&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Chores&lt;/h3&gt;
